><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"753\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"828\">📦 <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"790\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"793\">Ray-Ban Hawkeye RB0298S Zonnebril</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"887\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"852\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"855\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
